There are just too many pages for anyone person to maintain.
I focus my attention on what I refer to as the 'marketing' pages -=20
those that are likely to be seen by casual visitors or 'maybe-
I'm-interested' visitors.

So I review and update (as best I can) the following p[ages:
- Home (in English and Lojban)
- News (in English and Lojban)
- About
- What Others Say
- FAQ
- Learning
- The LLG
- Contact Us

I've also been looking for volunteers to translate the Home page=20
into other big languages. That's just about done, though we still need=20
someone for Arabic.

And, yes, it would be just great if some else 'took ownership'=20
of some of the other pages.

mu'o mi'e .totus.

